WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:03.450
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:05.760
Hey!  What’s wrong?

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:09.120
It seems it's the end for me.

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:13.490
Flame, I’ll get revenge for Cyberse World!

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:19.360
Due to Judgment Roll’s effect, its ATK become 0!

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:21.930
No way!

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:27.170
And you take damage equal to its original ATK.

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:31.920
Damn!

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.410
I’m going to lose.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:38.380
Sorry, Flame.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:45.320
Playmaker, I leave the rest to you.

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:54.200
Now I’ve finished my training for my battle against Playmaker.

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:57.260
Just wait, Playmaker!

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:04.010
Transfer this data to the Light Ignis immediately.

00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:05.240
Understood.

00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:13.480
This is a message from Revolver.

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:36.290
Our lives aren't forever

00:01:37.090 --> 00:01:43.080
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:01:44.030 --> 00:01:50.400
Even if it's not the right direction, just keep looking forward

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:56.970
Sharing hope for the future

00:01:56.970 --> 00:02:03.720
tell me  We're searching for memories lost in the darkness

00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:10.950
I feel your flame  Your impulses pierce the light

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:17.660
I want to share your pain

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:58.690
Revolver.

00:02:58.690 --> 00:03:02.660
I knew you'd come to me.

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:06.510
What's with that message?

00:03:06.510 --> 00:03:11.270
Like it said, I know your secret.

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:15.010
My secret?  What do you mean?

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:17.600
I have no secrets.

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:19.480
Are you sure?

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:26.720
When Spectre said your heart holds a secret, you looked very flustered.

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:31.050
Revolver, stop trying to test me.

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:33.960
You have no reason to look down on me.

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:37.650
You said the Ignis were imperfect.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:42.970
That's why you created a new AI - Bohman.  And destroyed Cyberse World.

00:03:42.970 --> 00:03:44.640
Exactly.

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:46.330
Then let me ask you.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:50.610
Why did you think the Ignis were imperfect?

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:52.310
What are you trying to say?

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:55.780
I’m saying I know the reason why.

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:00.590
I saw the simulation you did.

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:03.320
You…

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:05.560
That’s right.

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:10.960
Boss!  This place is beautiful!

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:14.730
Yes.  It may be the afterlife.

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:18.280
Then over there - is that Buddha and God?

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:23.820
That’s Revolver and Lightning!

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:26.340
They're the next to battle?

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:31.950
The only other duelists in this world are Playmaker and Bohman.

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:34.950
Isn't it weird?

00:04:34.950 --> 00:04:41.690
Revolver once tried to destroy the network world, but he's now fighting for us.

00:04:41.690 --> 00:04:44.460
Boss, who are you rooting for?

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:46.030
Isn’t it obvious?

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:49.880
If Revolver loses, the world will be in chaos!

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:52.540
Do your best, Revolver!

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:58.570
Soulburner and Flame are…

00:04:58.570 --> 00:05:03.520
The moment we arrived, we all knew something like this could happen.

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:06.000
That’s true, but-

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.960
Playmaker…

00:05:17.130 --> 00:05:19.850
Revolver!  Lightning!

00:05:19.850 --> 00:05:23.960
Lightning went after Revolver!

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:24.990
Let’s go!

00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:28.670
Are you sure you can move?

00:05:28.670 --> 00:05:30.970
Don't worry about that!

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:35.150
This pain is nothing compared to Soulburner’s!

00:05:35.150 --> 00:05:36.880
Playmaker…

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:39.850
I won’t let everyone’s sacrifices go to waste.

00:05:39.850 --> 00:05:43.590
And I promise to get revenge for my team!

00:05:55.770 --> 00:05:59.170
Revolver and the Light Ignis.

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:04.510
The Light Ignis went to Revolver, as he expected.

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:07.150
Revolver will definitely win.

00:06:07.150 --> 00:06:12.880
It’s finally time to atone for our crimes.

00:06:13.610 --> 00:06:19.270
Light Ignis, you used underhanded tactics to hide your flaws.

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:22.960
And lead the Ignis on the wrong path.

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:25.960
You made the situation worse.

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:27.830
It's all your fault.

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:29.790
Be quiet, Revolver.

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:36.810
You're annoying.  I must defeat you personally.

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:39.980
Let's see if you have what it takes!

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:43.210
Duel!

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:46.720
My turn.

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:51.190
I summon Armatos Legio Gladius.

00:06:51.190 --> 00:06:58.430
On the turn it's summoned, I can add the Field Spell, Armatos Colosseum to my hand.

00:06:58.430 --> 00:07:02.640
I activate the Field Spell, Armatos Colosseum!

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:19.520
When Armatos Colosseum is activated, I can add one Armatos Legio in my deck to my hand.

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:24.360
I add Armatos Legio Speculata to my hand!

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:28.260
Appear!  The circuit that guides the light!

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:33.330
The summoning condition is one Level 4 or lower Armatos Legio.

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:35.400
Link Summon!

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:40.220
Appear, Link 1 Armatos Legio Decurion!

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:45.440
The Field Spell, Armatos Colosseum’s effect activates!

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:52.570
I send a Level 4 or lower Armatos Legio in my hand to the graveyard.

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:55.520
Next to my Armatos Legio Link Monster’s links...

00:07:55.520 --> 00:08:03.700
...I Special Summon as many Armatos Legio as possible from the graveyard in defense position that’s different than the one I sent.

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:12.670
I send Armatos Legio Sica to the graveyard to Special Summon Gladius next to Decurion’s link!

00:08:12.670 --> 00:08:15.910
Then I activate Speculata’s effect from my hand.

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:24.080
I send a non-Speculata Armatos Legio from my hand to the graveyard to Special Summon Speculata.

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:28.090
Appear!  The circuit that guides the light!

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:32.390
The summoning conditions are two Armatos Legio!

00:08:33.850 --> 00:08:35.490
Link Summon!

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:40.230
Appear, Link 2 Armatos Legio Centurion!

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:46.740
For a third time!  The circuit that guides the light!

00:08:46.740 --> 00:08:52.310
The summoning conditions are at least two Armatos Legio Link Monsters.

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:56.680
Give new power to the knight of light!

00:08:56.680 --> 00:09:00.160
Now release your hidden power!

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:01.590
Link Summon!

00:09:01.590 --> 00:09:08.190
Appear, Link 3 Armatos Legio Plumbum Trident!

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:14.900
So that’s your new Armatos Legio.

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:17.900
Plumbum Trident’s effect!

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:23.910
When it's in the Extra Monster Zone, its ATK are doubled!

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:29.210
I set one card and end my turn.

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:32.990
Where are they?

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:34.220
Where?

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:36.060
I found them.  Over there!

00:09:36.060 --> 00:09:38.330
Wow!  A huge flower field!

00:09:38.330 --> 00:09:39.290
Let’s go!

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:40.760
Aye aye sir!

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:44.080
Revolver!

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:46.060
Playmaker.

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:52.120
Bohman…

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:53.940
He came too!

00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:58.110
Bohman…

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:01.580
Playmaker.

00:10:02.550 --> 00:10:07.290
I finished all my training for our fight.

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:12.020
By defeating your friends - Blue Maiden and Soulburner.

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:13.530
Bohman!

00:10:13.530 --> 00:10:14.760
That punk!

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:16.320
Training?  Whatever!

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:19.440
And I’ll watch your duel.

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:21.020
Perfect timing.

00:10:22.060 --> 00:10:23.950
Light Ignis!

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:29.290
They're here to watch me expose your crimes.

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:35.260
Lightning’s crimes?

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:36.800
Crimes?

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:41.620
I can’t forgive what he’s done, but he did other things too?

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:47.480
Dark Ignis, free will is your desire to do something.

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:50.030
Where is free will located?

00:10:50.030 --> 00:10:52.450
What?  A quiz?

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:54.940
And a hard one...

00:10:54.940 --> 00:10:59.140
For humans, free will is in the head.

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:01.110
Are you sure?

00:11:01.110 --> 00:11:02.700
I’m wrong?

00:11:02.700 --> 00:11:05.340
What you’re talking about are memories.

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:06.920
Memories?

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:09.500
Then…

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:11.770
I know!  The heart!

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:14.750
No, a heart can’t think.

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:19.690
My father's death - That's memory.

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:24.060
Due to that memory, I vowed revenge.

00:11:24.060 --> 00:11:25.660
That’s free will.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:30.050
If free will is a part of memories...

00:11:30.050 --> 00:11:36.360
...by repeatedly remembering my memory where I vowed revenge, that turns into free will.

00:11:36.360 --> 00:11:38.990
What kind of nonsense is that?

00:11:38.990 --> 00:11:42.650
What does that have to do with Lightning’s crime?

00:11:42.650 --> 00:11:46.990
Humans' free will is complex and bizarre.

00:11:46.990 --> 00:11:51.360
That’s why we still don’t know where it's located.

00:11:51.820 --> 00:11:54.360
But it’s different for you AI.

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:56.730
What do you mean?

00:11:56.730 --> 00:12:02.400
Your thoughts are always kept somewhere as data.

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:07.130
By looking at your data, I can learn about your free will.

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:12.810
For many years, I analyzed your data.

00:12:12.810 --> 00:12:18.490
And right before I came here, I finally finished.

00:12:18.490 --> 00:12:22.520
You saw Lightning’s free will in that data?

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:23.610
That’s right.

00:12:23.610 --> 00:12:28.870
The Light Ignis thought the Ignis were imperfect.

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:32.500
So he created a new vessel known as Bohman.

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:35.370
You never wondered why?

00:12:35.370 --> 00:12:38.370
Well...  Yeah, I did!

00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:44.380
But Lightning's an elite leader, the AI who led the Cyberse World.

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:48.480
Since he's elite, I thought he had his reasons.

00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:52.120
I didn't expect that answer from an AI.

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:57.600
Caught up in the Light Ignis's aura, you just obeyed him.

00:12:57.600 --> 00:13:03.900
Yeah!  Because he’s the world’s first AI with instinct!

00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:11.880
Well...  Dark Ignis, you did neglect your own duties and let the other Ignis do all the work.

00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:15.910
You looked at my data too?

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:19.070
Don’t reveal my dark history!

00:13:19.070 --> 00:13:21.110
Enough with this chatter!

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:24.120
No.  I want to hear.

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:26.450
I’m interested in this tale.

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:30.200
You really want to hear about my dark history?

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:31.070
Not that.

00:13:31.070 --> 00:13:32.460
You don’t?

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:35.690
Uh, I mean- thank goodness!

00:13:35.690 --> 00:13:38.380
I have the right to know.

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:41.670
Because you created me.

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:47.580
Tell us.  What’s Lightning’s crime?

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:49.510
Tell it to us straight!

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:51.980
Lightning’s crime…

00:13:52.380 --> 00:13:54.980
And Lightning’s free will…

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:58.320
That data was in the simulation.

00:13:58.320 --> 00:13:59.880
Simulation?

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:04.420
Light Ignis, after you acquired Cyberse World...

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:10.830
...you did several billion simulations on the future of the Ignis’s relationship with humans.

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:15.300
He wanted to know about their future?

00:14:15.300 --> 00:14:18.270
He did that?  How smart!

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:22.510
But that was the start of your tragedy.

00:14:22.510 --> 00:14:25.610
The start of tragedy?  What do you mean?

00:14:25.610 --> 00:14:32.780
Light Ignis, the result of the simulations was something you couldn’t predict.

00:14:32.780 --> 00:14:41.230
For each Ignis, there was some hope that their future relationship with humans would prosper.

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:42.540
What?

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:44.030
Wait a sec!

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:50.230
Dr. Kogami's simulations said we would annihilate humans!  He was wrong?

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:54.590
My father did simulations on all the Ignis.

00:14:54.590 --> 00:14:57.280
His results are accurate.

00:14:57.280 --> 00:14:59.440
What do you mean?

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:02.450
They're accurate when the Ignis are grouped as one.

00:15:02.450 --> 00:15:08.450
But by doing simulations on each Ignis individually, the cause was revealed.

00:15:08.450 --> 00:15:12.750
Each Ignis’s relationship with humans...

00:15:12.750 --> 00:15:17.610
One Ignis's future didn't prosper.  One was an exception.

00:15:17.610 --> 00:15:18.920
Exception?

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:21.770
Yes.  That exception…

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:25.080
...is you, Light Ignis!

00:15:29.160 --> 00:15:37.920
Your future with humans affects all simulations, leading to the annihilation of both humans and Ignis.

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:39.380
Seriously?

00:15:39.380 --> 00:15:44.990
Currently, you no longer leave behind analyzable data.

00:15:44.990 --> 00:15:49.230
But when you were born, you weren't smart enough yet.

00:15:49.230 --> 00:15:50.960
Be quiet, Revolver!

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:54.320
You couldn’t handle the results.

00:15:54.320 --> 00:16:01.440
I didn’t discuss it with Spectre, but he instinctively detected the darkness in your heart!

00:16:01.950 --> 00:16:05.880
Because you're a bit arrogant.

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:10.450
The cause of your arrogance is a complex.

00:16:10.450 --> 00:16:14.510
In other words, you have some sort of complex.

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:18.190
You must have a secret you never told anyone.

00:16:19.610 --> 00:16:23.450
This is Lightning’s complex that Spectre mentioned.

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:27.310
That’s right.  Having free will is a contradiction.

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:31.770
Light Ignis, that’s why you fell.

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:38.140
That means Lightning is the worst Ignis?

00:16:38.410 --> 00:16:39.960
Be quiet, Ai!

00:16:39.960 --> 00:16:43.250
Someone like you can't look down on me!

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:47.550
Do you think I’ll be quiet because you tell me to?

00:16:47.550 --> 00:16:52.220
Light Ignis, you are not an elite AI!

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:57.960
Acting more elite than the other Ignis was just a desperate plan!

00:16:57.960 --> 00:17:01.430
You're the root of all evil!

00:17:01.430 --> 00:17:07.540
Revolver, I didn't expect you to analyze the data.

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:15.850
As you said, I started thinking that Ignis were immature programs due to the simulation's results.

00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:21.920
I don't accept that I'm inferior to the other Ignis!

00:17:22.300 --> 00:17:25.560
That’s why I created Bohman.

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:28.630
To make up for our flaws.

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:33.440
"Our?"  It’s "your" flaw!

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:37.600
That’s why you selfishly destroyed Cyberse World?

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:40.300
That’s right.  What’s wrong with that?

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:44.120
What’s wrong?  You must be joking!

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:47.140
That’s why you got us involved in this fight?

00:17:47.140 --> 00:17:50.150
It’s your fault that everyone is gone!

00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:53.850
Earth!  Windy!  Aqua!  Flame!

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:55.930
No problem with that.

00:17:55.930 --> 00:18:00.830
In the end, we'll all be reborn as one.

00:18:00.830 --> 00:18:04.200
Something's wrong with him!

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:10.570
Light Ignis, free will is something that's too much for you to handle.

00:18:10.570 --> 00:18:20.040
I’ll show you that if evil walks the path of selfishness, it'll lead to a foolish future!

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:21.880
Here I go!

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:24.480
My turn!  I draw!

00:18:24.480 --> 00:18:28.890
I activate the Field Spell, Boot Sector Launch!

00:18:28.890 --> 00:18:33.360
I Special Summon up to two Rokket monsters in defense position!

00:18:33.360 --> 00:18:39.360
I Special Summon Magnarokket Dragon and Anesthrokket Dragon!

00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:44.370
Appear!  The future circuit that lights up my path!

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:48.240
The summoning conditions are two Rokket monsters!

00:18:48.240 --> 00:18:49.940
Link Summon!

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:53.820
Appear!  Link 2 Booster Dragon!

00:18:55.310 --> 00:18:58.700
Then I Special Summon Gateway Dragon!

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:05.220
When there's a Link Monster on your field, I can Special Summon this card from my hand!

00:19:05.220 --> 00:19:09.230
I activate the spell card, Cross Linkage Hack!

00:19:09.230 --> 00:19:17.200
When a non-Link Monster on my field is linked with my and your Link Monster...

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:19.900
...I draw two cards from my deck!

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:22.910
Gateway Dragon’s effect activates!

00:19:22.910 --> 00:19:28.750
I Special Summon a Level 4 or lower Dark Dragon from my hand!

00:19:28.750 --> 00:19:32.600
Appear, Autorokket Dragon!

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:37.820
1900 ATK.

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:41.960
It’s not enough against Lightning’s Trident's ATK.

00:19:41.960 --> 00:19:45.820
But he now has the foundation to destroy Judgment Arrows.

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:48.000
I see!

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:51.800
If he uses Booster Dragon’s effect on Autorokket...

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:56.820
...Autorokket will be destroyed, and he can send his opponent’s spell or trap to the graveyard!

00:19:56.820 --> 00:19:58.480
That’s right.

00:19:58.480 --> 00:20:02.950
If that’s your counter against Judgment Arrows, it won't work.

00:20:03.380 --> 00:20:07.050
I activate the Continuous Trap, Armatos Gloria!

00:20:07.050 --> 00:20:11.640
Card effects can't destroy or banish cards on the field!

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:20.400
If this faceup card in the Spell & Trap Zone is the target of an effect, all my monsters are destroyed!

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:21.600
What?

00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:24.800
A card that protects Judgment Arrows.

00:20:24.800 --> 00:20:29.650
But Autorokket’s effect doesn't destroy the opponent’s card.

00:20:29.650 --> 00:20:31.400
It sends it to the graveyard.

00:20:31.400 --> 00:20:32.780
If he uses that-

00:20:32.780 --> 00:20:34.680
No, he can’t do that either.

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:40.680
Due to Armatos Gloria, effects can't destroy monsters.

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:45.620
Autorokket’s effect doesn't activate unless it's destroyed.

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:47.290
Oh my god!

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:52.230
Lightning had a counter to Judgment Arrows’s counter!

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:53.860
That’s not all.

00:20:53.860 --> 00:20:56.570
Lightning is thinking further ahead.

00:20:56.570 --> 00:20:59.800
No way!  There’s more?

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:08.050
One of Revolver’s ace monsters, Topologic Trisbaena, can use its effect to banish all spell and traps.

00:21:08.050 --> 00:21:10.500
And he stopped that too!

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:14.050
He has a counter to a counter to a counter!

00:21:14.050 --> 00:21:16.750
I can’t think that far ahead!

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:18.640
Of course not, Ai.

00:21:18.640 --> 00:21:21.160
I’m not lower class like you.

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:22.630
How laughable!

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:26.660
You act like an elite AI because you thought of a counter?

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:30.830
Appear!  The future circuit that lights up my path!

00:21:30.830 --> 00:21:35.040
The summoning conditions are at least three Effect Monsters!

00:21:39.380 --> 00:21:43.680
My gale that slices open the closed world!

00:21:43.680 --> 00:21:45.920
Link Summon!

00:21:45.920 --> 00:21:50.650
Appear!  Link 4 Borreload Dragon!

00:21:55.680 --> 00:21:57.360
Prepare yourself!

00:21:57.360 --> 00:22:03.300
This noble monster will discipline you!

00:22:05.390 --> 00:22:09.330
I was told repeatedly

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:16.810
Only tales of dreams

00:22:17.160 --> 00:22:23.780
Is my life precious?

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:26.750
Make up for  Make up for

00:22:27.140 --> 00:22:34.290
The next sentimental

00:22:39.120 --> 00:22:45.540
I'm not a machine

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:51.980
I cry a single tear

00:22:53.470 --> 00:22:57.180
A single answer moves me

00:22:58.370 --> 00:23:07.560
We helplessly sing for someone we can't reach

00:23:08.180 --> 00:23:12.960
Are you ready?

00:23:13.490 --> 00:23:18.340
Oh oh oh

00:23:18.860 --> 00:23:23.540
Are you ready?

00:23:24.160 --> 00:23:30.650
Are you ready?

00:23:37.460 --> 00:23:42.770
Lightning declares that humans are not needed.

00:23:42.770 --> 00:23:48.640
This Ignis's ideas are too extreme.  He must be destroyed.

00:23:48.640 --> 00:23:55.000
With renewed affirmation, Revolver unleashes a new dragon.

00:23:55.000 --> 00:23:58.880
Two Level 4 monsters...  Can it be?

00:23:59.380 --> 00:24:03.520
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Ignis Unification Plan

00:24:03.520 --> 00:24:06.000
Into the VRAINS!
